{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/collectiondifference\/enumerated()"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"enumerated()","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"symbolKind":"method","externalID":"s:STsE10enumerateds18EnumeratedSequenceVyxGyF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s20CollectionDifferenceV","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"10.10","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"9.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS","unavailable":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS","unavailable":false},{"name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"introducedAt":"2.0"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","modules":[{"name":"Standard Library"}],"role":"symbol"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"enumerated","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"() -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV","text":"EnumeratedSequence","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EnumeratedSequence"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A sequence of pairs enumerating the sequence."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This example enumerates the characters of the string “Swift” and prints"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each character along with its place in the string."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["for (n, c) in \"Swift\".enumerated() {","    print(\"\\(n): '\\(c)'\")","}","\/\/ Prints \"0: 'S'\"","\/\/ Prints \"1: 'w'\"","\/\/ Prints \"2: 'i'\"","\/\/ Prints \"3: 'f'\"","\/\/ Prints \"4: 't'\""]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When you enumerate a collection, the integer part of each pair is a counter"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"for the enumeration, but is not necessarily the index of the paired value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"These counters can be used as indices only in instances of zero-based,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"integer-indexed collections, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"Array","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"ContiguousArray","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other collections the counters may be out of range or of the wrong type","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to use as an index. To iterate over the elements of a collection with its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"indices, use the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"zip(_:_:)"},{"text":" function.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This example iterates over the indices and elements of a set, building a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"list consisting of indices of names with five or fewer letters.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let names: Set = [\"Sofia\", \"Camilla\", \"Martina\", \"Mateo\", \"Nicolás\"]","var shorterIndices: [Set<String>.Index] = []","for (i, name) in zip(names.indices, names) {","    if name.count <= 5 {","        shorterIndices.append(i)","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Now that the "},{"code":"shorterIndices","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array holds the indices of the shorter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"names in the ","type":"text"},{"code":"names","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" set, you can use those indices to access elements in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the set.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["for i in shorterIndices {","    print(names[i])","}","\/\/ Prints \"Sofia\"","\/\/ Prints \"Mateo\""],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(1)"}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionDifference"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionDifference\/enumerated()"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a sequence of pairs ("},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"type":"text","text":"), where "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}]},{"type":"text","text":" represents a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consecutive integer starting at zero and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"type":"text","text":" represents an element of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence."}],"references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/CollectionDifference/enumerated()":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"enumerated()","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionDifference\/enumerated()","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"enumerated"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"EnumeratedSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:s18EnumeratedSequenceV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/collectiondifference\/enumerated()","abstract":[{"text":"Returns a sequence of pairs (","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"x","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"n","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" represents a","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"consecutive integer starting at zero and "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"x"}]},{"type":"text","text":" represents an element of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the sequence."}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/CollectionDifference":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"CollectionDifference","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"CollectionDifference","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/CollectionDifference","role":"symbol","title":"CollectionDifference","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/collectiondifference","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"A collection of insertions and removals that describe the difference","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"between two ordered collection states.","type":"text"}]},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift","type":"topic","title":"Standard Library","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Standard Library","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Browse the essential types provided by Swift’s standard library."}],"role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/EnumeratedSequence":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/EnumeratedSequence","type":"topic","title":"EnumeratedSequence","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"EnumeratedSequence","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An enumeration of the elements of a sequence or collection."}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/enumeratedsequence"}}}